# Projects showcase layout

## Case detail first screen (`/projects/[slug]`)

Default opening stack (before body copy / gallery):

1. **Hero video** — **full viewport** (`100dvh`), pulled under the sticky header (`margin-top: -header`). Prefer **Vimeo background embed** (`heroVimeoId` / `heroVimeoHash`; default demo `1172594711` / `3452b6dd22`). Autoplay muted loop, no chrome.
2. **Nav at rest** — clear / no frost (`is-over-clear` + difference), same as home hero — video must sit behind the bar.
3. **Meta** — **inside** the video frame, near the bottom (shell-aligned). Same three slots as the featured lead: **title left** · **tagline center** · **tags right**. Type is white + `mix-blend-mode: difference` (same invert language as Projects hero roll / clear header).

## Case detail copy stack (after hero) — ALWAYS these four

White band, Apple label black (`#1d1d1f`). Same shell width as the in-video meta. **No border / frame.**

Every project detail copy area is **only** this sequence (order fixed):

1. **Background** — left label **`Background`**. Right: headline + body. Fields: `statementHeadline`, `overview`.
2. **Challenges** — left `Challenges`. Right: headline + body. Fields: `challengesHeadline`, `challengesBody`.
3. **Execution** — left `Execution`. Right: headline + body. Fields: `executionHeadline`, `executionBody`.
4. **Impact** — left `Impact`. Right: headline + body. Fields: `impactHeadline`, `impactBody`.

Each chapter uses the same layout:

1. **Left — big label:** uppercase, **left-aligned**.
2. **Right — copy group:** container flush to shell right (`justify-self: end`); text itself **left-aligned** LTR. Headline uppercase + Regular body.

Built via `getCaseCopySections` + `ProjectCaseCopy`. Missing fields get short placeholder copy so the four chapters always render.

**Images:** do **not** invent a global image pattern. Wait for per-project direction on how images insert / weave between these chapters.

## Cover ratios

1. **Featured lead (first)** — `1920 × 1080` (exact 16:9).
2. **Two-column cards** — `3000 × 1687` (~16:9; use `aspect-ratio: 3000 / 1687`).

## Featured lead meta (full width)

Further-style single row: **title left** · **tagline center** · **tags right** (` · ` separators).

## Two-column card meta (match reference)

Under the image:

```
TITLE (left, bold/heavy)          TAGS (right, light, comma-separated)
Tagline under the title (left)
```

Not a three-column horizontal bar. Title and tags share the top baseline; copy sits under the title.

These fields feed the filter system later — keep as structured data.

## Page arrangement (`/projects`)

1. **First project** — full width of the menu/`shell`.
2. **Everything after** — **two equal-width columns**. Same meta stack on every card.

## Do not

- Return to irregular masonry / auto-fill multi-column grids for the showcase
- Mix the featured three-column meta into two-column cards (or vice versa)
- Skip or reorder Background → Challenges → Execution → Impact on case pages
- Invent case-page image layouts until the user specifies them per project
